Syntax grammars, themes and the file-name table

r12-render-grammar.ts and r12-render-grammar-<n>.ts are generated by tools/grammar/gen-grammar.mjs from
the TextMate grammars of @shikijs/langs 4.2.0 (MIT, Shiki contributors), the grammars the reference
T3 Code bundles through Shiki, and from the pierre-light / pierre-dark themes of @pierre/theme 1.1.0
(MIT). Each grammar keeps the licence of its upstream repository, which the tm-grammars package
(1.31.15) records with the grammar's source: MIT for 176 of the 253; Apache-2.0 for 18 (actionscript-3,
ara, ballerina, cadence, cairo, erlang, gleam, gn, jsonnet, kdl, lean, moonbit, ocaml, pkl, polar,
prisma, puppet, surrealql); BSD-3-Clause for haskell; ISC for emacs-lisp; MPL-2.0 for bird2, hcl and
terraform; GPL-3.0 for ada, gnuplot, nginx and racket; NOASSERTION for 11 (apache, apex, asciidoc, cue,
elixir, llvm, luau, nim, purescript, sass, wolfram); none stated for 21 (abap, apl, applescript, dax,
dream-maker, erb, glsl, hurl, kusto, logo, matlab, mipsasm, po, rel, sparql, ssh-config, tcl, toml,
ts-tags, turtle, yaml); and the 18 grammars Shiki packages only for embedding (the angular-*,
es-tag-*, vue-* and markdown-* injections, cpp-macro, jinja-html) are not listed there.
r12-render-filetypes.ts follows the file-name table of @pierre/diffs 1.3.0-beta.10 (Apache-2.0).
